# Fallback .dockerignore. NOT the one that actually governs any of this
# repo's image builds: the compose build context for every service is the
# monorepo root (../..), so BuildKit resolves ignore rules from a file named
# after the Dockerfile in its own directory instead --
# infra/docker/Dockerfile.<svc>.dockerignore -- per
# https://docs.docker.com/build/concepts/context/#filename-and-location.
# This file exists only for tooling that falls back to a plain
# ".dockerignore" next to the Dockerfile regardless of BuildKit's
# per-Dockerfile convention (e.g. `docker build` with BuildKit disabled).
# Keep it in sync with the six Dockerfile.<svc>.dockerignore files.

.git
.gitignore
.github
.vscode
.idea
*.DS_Store

**/node_modules
**/.pnpm-store
**/.turbo
**/coverage
**/playwright-report
**/test-results

**/.next
**/dist
**/build
**/out
**/*.tsbuildinfo

**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
**/.venv
**/.pytest_cache
**/.mypy_cache
**/.ruff_cache

docs
infra/loadtest
infra/loadtest/results
infra/k8s
infra/observability
infra/ci
DESIGN.md
*.log

.env
.env.*
!.env.example
infra/docker/.env
infra/docker/.env.*
!infra/docker/.env.example
